1
00:00:00,528 --> 00:00:02,877
Bhaiya, poora dabba expire!

2
00:00:03,998 --> 00:00:04,558
Phir se?!

3
00:00:08,402 --> 00:00:09,873
Sabse bada nuksaan?

4
00:00:10,117 --> 00:00:11,829
Chori nahi... shelf par.

5
00:00:14,835 --> 00:00:16,943
Dawa chupchaap expire hoti rahi.

6
00:00:17,273 --> 00:00:17,836
Kitni?

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,335
Kabhi gina hi nahi.

8
00:00:20,677 --> 00:00:25,099
Sochiye... mahine ke ₹500, saal ke ₹6,000.

9
00:00:26,255 --> 00:00:28,445
Ab subah sabse pehle... ye.

10
00:00:31,029 --> 00:00:34,081
Expiry, low stock — pehli nazar mein.

11
00:00:36,772 --> 00:00:40,982
Kaunsa batch, kitne din, kitna paisa — sab saamne.

12
00:00:42,149 --> 00:00:44,167
Raju, ye batch aage rakho.

13
00:00:44,452 --> 00:00:45,906
Ji, Didi!

14
00:00:47,036 --> 00:00:47,718
Aur ab?

15
00:00:47,969 --> 00:00:50,686
Ab dabbe khulte hain... bikne ke liye.

16
00:00:52,573 --> 00:00:56,763
Expiry se pehle alert. Nexcod POS.
